---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'July 30, 2026';
---

<Layout
  title="Affiliate Disclosure — The HR Stack Guide"
  description="Learn how The HR Stack Guide is compensated, how that relates to our independent review process, and how we stay compliant with FTC endorsement guidelines."
>
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 lg:py-14">
    <header class="mb-10">
      <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <ol class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-500">
          <li><a href="/" class="transition hover:text-indigo-600">Home</a></li>
          <li aria-hidden="true" class="text-slate-300">&gt;</li>
          <li class="font-medium text-indigo-600" aria-current="page">Affiliate Disclosure</li>
        </ol>
      </nav>
      <h1 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl">
        Affiliate Disclosure
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm font-medium text-slate-500">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
    </header>

    <article class="space-y-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm sm:p-8">
      <section>
        <p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
          The HR Stack Guide is published by Stack Guide Media. In accordance with the Federal Trade
          Commission's 16 CFR Part 255 guidelines on endorsements and testimonials, we want to be fully
          transparent about how this site is funded and how that relates to the recommendations we publish.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">How we make money</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
          Some of the links on The HR Stack Guide, including the "Try [Vendor]" buttons on our comparison
          pages, are affiliate links. If you click one of these links and subsequently sign up for, trial, or
          purchase a vendor's product, we may earn a commission from that vendor. This comes at
          <strong>no extra cost to you</strong> — the price you pay is the same whether you use our link or go
          directly to the vendor's website.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Our independence policy</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
          Whether or not a vendor participates in an affiliate program never determines whether that vendor is
          included in a comparison, and it never changes the star ratings we assign. Our ratings are based on
          publicly available pricing, product documentation, feature sets, and vendor-published policies,
          evaluated against a consistent rubric across every tool we cover. When a specific vendor is highlighted
          as the best fit for a use case (for example "Winner for Global EOR"), that recommendation is grounded in
          documented product capabilities relevant to that use case, not in commission rates.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Editorial process</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
          Our comparison content is produced by our B2B software operations analysts using a repeatable
          methodology: we review each vendor's official pricing pages, product documentation, and public
          customer feedback, then map their capabilities against the needs of the audience segment described
          on each page (for example, tech startups, agencies, or mid-market scaleups). We periodically
          re-review vendors as pricing and features change.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Identifying sponsored links</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
          Outbound links to vendor websites on this site are marked with the <code class="rounded bg-slate-100 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-sm">rel="sponsored"</code>
          attribute where applicable, consistent with search engine guidance for identifying paid or affiliate
          relationships.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900">Questions</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
          If you have questions about a specific recommendation or about our affiliate relationships, contact
          us at <a href="mailto:hello@thehrstackguide.com" class="font-medium text-indigo-600 hover:underline">hello@thehrstackguide.com</a>.
          You can also review our <a href="/privacy-policy" class="font-medium text-indigo-600 hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a>
          and <a href="/terms" class="font-medium text-indigo-600 hover:underline">Terms of Service</a> for more information.
        </p>
      </section>
    </article>
  </main>
</Layout>
